      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, thanks for having a look.\nNot sure I understood your question correctly.\n\nThere is currently just no way to set this flag to a physical display. The only way (as far as I figured out) currently implemented is using the VIRTUAL_DISPLAY_FLAG_STEAL_TOP_FOCUS_DISABLED as display flag in createVirtualDisplay. There is no similar call for adding a physical display. \n\nFor the same reason I assume config_localPrivateDisplayPorts has been added to be able to give physical displays the FLAG_PRIVATE display flag. In this patch I copied the config_localPrivateDisplayPorts solution.",
